    <item>
      <title>:anchor: Install</title>
      <link>https://tamada.github.io/9rules/install/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://tamada.github.io/9rules/install/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:beer: Homebrew&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;beer-homebrew&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#beer-homebrew&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Install 9rules via &lt;a href=&#34;https://brew.sh&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Homebrew&lt;/a&gt;, simply run:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight-wrapper&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ brew tap tamada/brew&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ brew install ninerules&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;9rules&lt;/code&gt; command (wrapper for shell script) will be installed.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:muscle: Install yourself&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;muscle-install-yourself&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#muscle-install-yourself&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight-wrapper&#34;&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-sh&#34; data-lang=&#34;sh&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ git clone https://github.com/tamada/9rules.git&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ cd 9rules&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$ mvn package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:briefcase: Requirements&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;briefcase-requirements&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#briefcase-requirements&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Runtime&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Java 8 or later.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Development&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Maven 3.x&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Dependencies&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;JDT Core 3.10.0&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Vavr 0.10.3&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Dependencies (the Unit Tests)&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;JUnit 4.12&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Hamcreset all 1.3&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>:page_facing_up: Rules</title>
      <link>https://tamada.github.io/9rules/rules/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://tamada.github.io/9rules/rules/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Rules&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;rules&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#rules&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This tool checks the 9 rules of small object programming for the Java source codes.&#xA;Originally, 9 rules were shown in &lt;a href=&#34;http://shop.oreilly.com/product/9781934356142.do&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;The ThoughtWorks Anthology&lt;/a&gt;.&#xA;The rules are as follows.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rule # 1. Use one level of indentation per method.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rule # 2. Do not use the &lt;code&gt;else&lt;/code&gt; keyword.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rule # 3. Wrap all primitives and &lt;code&gt;String&lt;/code&gt;s.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rule # 4. Use only one dot per line.&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Except the following items.&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;one line comments,&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;string literals,&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;this.&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;lines of &lt;code&gt;import&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;line of &lt;code&gt;package&lt;/code&gt;,&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;first characters in the line,&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;variadic methods, and&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;System.out.print(ln|f)?&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rule # 5. Do not abbreviate.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rule # 6. Keep all entities small.&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The length of each method is less than 3 lines.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The length of each class is less than 50 lines.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;The class files in a package are less than 10 files.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rule # 7. Do not use any classes with more than two instance variables.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rule # 8. Use first-class collections.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rule # 9. Do not use any getters/setters/properties.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Implementation&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;implementation&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#implementation&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The tool can check above rules except rule # 5.&#xA;To check rule # 5 must be refer the dictionaries.&#xA;Of course, a library like &lt;a href=&#34;https://wordnet.princeton.edu&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;WordNet&lt;/a&gt; enables to check rule # 5.&#xA;However, the tool does not implement the rule yet.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>:running: Usage</title>
      <link>https://tamada.github.io/9rules/usage/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://tamada.github.io/9rules/usage/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:fork_and_knife: Usage of 9rules&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;fork_and_knife-usage-of-9rules&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#fork_and_knife-usage-of-9rules&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;9rules is an executable jar, therefore, simply type &lt;code&gt;java -jar 9rules-VERSION.jar&lt;/code&gt;,&#xA;and specified java source codes and source code directory.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Then, the tool checks each java source code and reports the results of the check.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:balloon: Example&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;balloon-example&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#balloon-example&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We assume that the project was cloned and compiled with &lt;a href=&#34;http://maven.apache.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Maven 3&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>:smile: About the project</title>
      <link>https://tamada.github.io/9rules/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://tamada.github.io/9rules/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://gitter.im/9rules/Lobby?utm_source=badge&amp;amp;utm_medium=badge&amp;amp;utm_campaign=pr-badge&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;low&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;Gitter&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;https://badges.gitter.im/9rules/Lobby.svg&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/tamada/9rules/blob/master/LICENSE&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;low&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;License&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/License-Apache%202.0-blue.svg?style=flat&#34;&#xA;    &gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:hammer_and_wrench: How to contribute the project&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;hammer_and_wrench-how-to-contribute-the-project&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#hammer_and_wrench-how-to-contribute-the-project&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Fork the project. (&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/tamada/9rules/fork&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://github.com/tamada/9rules/fork&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Create a feature branch. (&lt;code&gt;git switch -c FEATURE_BRANCH_NAME&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Edit the source files and Commit your changes.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Create tests and commit them.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rebase your local changes against the master branch.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Run the test suite with the &lt;code&gt;mvn package&lt;/code&gt; and confirm that passes.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Create a new pull request.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Confirm all checks pass.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:man_office_worker: Authors :woman_office_worker:&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;man_office_worker-authors-woman_office_worker&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#man_office_worker-authors-woman_office_worker&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/tamada&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;Haruaki Tamada&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;:jack_o_lantern: Icons of 9rules&#xA;    &lt;div id=&#34;jack_o_lantern-icons-of-9rules&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;span&#xA;        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#jack_o_lantern-icons-of-9rules&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/span&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;figure&gt;&#xA;      &lt;img class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34; src=&#34;https://tamada.github.io/9rules/images/logo.svg&#34; alt=&#34;9rules logo&#34; /&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;If you use the logo, please use &lt;a href=&#34;https://tamada.github.io/9rules/images/logo.svg&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;logo.svg&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;https://tamada.github.io/9rules/images/logo.png&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;logo.png&lt;/a&gt;, both images are located on &lt;a href=&#34;https://tamada.github.io/9rules/images/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noreferrer&#34;&gt;https://tamada.github.io/9rules/images/&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
